# SQ program to print fibonacci sequence

PRINTTEXT First 10 fibonacci numbers:

# push 0 and 1 to queue
PUSH 0
STORE
POP

PUSH 1
STORE
POP

REPEAT 10

# Load prev next
LOAD
LOAD

STORE   # save next to queue
ADD     # next + prev
PRINT   # print

STORE   # add the (next + prev) into queue
POP

ENDREPEAT
